+| `scratch\re\portraits\p1.py`-`p11.py` | Throwaway scans: decode, layout, palette search, pairing, sheet matching |
+| `scripts\permanent\patches\gohan_portraits.py` | Task 7 patch: relocated portrait table and the new gi portraits |
